    <div id="mainContent">
            <p class="Division"><a name="10.50.10"></a>Division 10-50.10:<br />Purpose</p>


            <p class="digCH">Sections:</p>

            <p class="CiteTOC"><a href="../Flagstaff10/Flagstaff1050010.html#10.50.10.010">10-50.10.010</a>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Purpose</p>

      <h3 class="Cite" id="10.50.10.010"><a name="10.50.10.010">10-50.10.010</a> Purpose</h3>
            <p class="P0">This chapter provides standards that are supplemental to the regulations of each zone, and are specific to particular aspects of development, such as landscaping, parking, outdoor lighting, and signage, among others. These standards are intended to promote development that compliments the unique, historic character of Flagstaff, while preserving and enhancing the natural resources and environments that are embraced by the local community and visitors alike. This chapter is also intended to encourage a character and quality of development that reinforces the natural, walkable urban, or drivable suburban contexts within Flagstaff.</p>

    </div>
